OL,5,G1400 All Creatures Great and Small
OL,6,     FJames has a bout of brucellosis,
OL,7,     Fbringing buried emotions to the
OL,8,     Fsurface. A broken-down car forces
OL,9,     FSiegfried and Tristan to
OL,10,     Frenegotiate their relationship,
OL,11,     Fwith amusing consequences.
